        "category": "dialogue",
        "english": "I know that I'm nowhere near as dedicated as you are",
        "vietnamese": "Tôi biết rằng tôi còn khuya mới có tâm được như ông",
        "speaker": "M",
        "audio_url": null,
        "beat_prosody": "I know that I'm nowhere near as dedicated as you are"
